==History==
2016
*The Dark Prince [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 29/2/2016, in the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update.]]
*On 23/3/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/3/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Dark Prince's charge speed to 120 (from 138).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May%202016%20Update%20(3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], changed the Dark Prince's card description. It used to say, “''Dealing area damage with each swing and double after charging, the Dark Prince is a formidable fighter. To harm his squishy core, break his shield first.''” The update also fixed the “range bug”, which decreased the Dark Prince's range to 1.05 tiles (from 1.8 tiles), but his effective range was unchanged.
*On 4/7/2016, the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]], increased the Dark Prince's damage by 8% and made him unaffected by pushback.
*On 24/8/2016, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(24/8/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Dark Prince's damage by 7.5%.
2017
*On 13/2/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (13/2/2017)|Balance Update]], increased the Dark Prince's hitpoints by 5%.
*On 11/8/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (11/8/2017)|Balance Update]], increased the Dark Prince's damage by 6% and decreased his attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1.5 seconds).
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic%20Quests%20Update%20(9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], fixed a bug where the [[Inferno Tower]]'s and [[Inferno Dragon]]'s damage did not reset after breaking the Dark Prince's shield. This change was reverted on 11/10/2017, in a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(11/10/2017)|maintenance break]].
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]] reverted the Dark Prince to his state on 9/10/2017. More specifically, the Inferno Tower's and Inferno Dragon's damage would now reset after breaking the Dark Prince's shield.
2018
*On 12/2/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (12/2/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Dark Prince's hitpoints by 5%, decreased his attack time interval to 1.3 seconds (from 1.4 seconds), and decreased his first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.5 seconds)
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], decreased the Dark Prince’s shield hitpoints by 25%.
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], increased the distance required for charging to 3.5 tiles (from 2.5 tiles).
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
2019
*On 6/5/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/5/2019)|Balance Update]], increased his range to 1.25 tiles (from 1.05 tiles) and increased his area radius and charge area radius to 1.25 tiles (from 1 tile).
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July%202019%20Update%20(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]], decreased the Dark Prince's range to 1.2 tiles (from 1.25 tiles), now classified as Melee: Medium, and decreased his area radius and charge area radius to 1.2 tiles (from 1.25 tiles).
*On 2/9/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/9/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Dark Prince's area radius to 1.1 tiles (from 1.2 tiles).
2021
*On 2/9/2021, a maintenance break, added a card render to the Dark Prince's card info screen.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 3/2/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/2/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Dark Prince's hitpoints by 3% and gave him the ability to jump the river.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the distance required from charging to 3 tiles (from 3.5 tiles).
*On 1/9/2025, a [[Version_History#Balance_Changes_(1/9/2025)|Balance Update]] increased the Dark Prince's damage by 7% and his charge damage by 7%.
2026

* On 4/5/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Dark Prince's Hit Speed to 1.4s (from 1.3s)

